519 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 378 0 R
/E (Vineyard Days 2026 made history with our first-ever motorized parade, and the community showed up in a big way! From creative floats and decorated vehicles to local organizations, businesses, and community groups, the parade route was filled with excitement and community pride.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
520 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 378 0 R
/E (One of the most meaningful moments of this year's Vineyard Days Parade was the tribute to our veterans and the remembrance of Augusto D'Avila, a dedicated member of the VFW Post 4918 Timpanogos Post Color Guard. Following Augusto's passing, his daughter and son stepped forward to carry on his role during the flag presentation, honoring their father's legacy of service, patriotism, and commitment to the community.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 378 0 R
/E (Their participation was a powerful reminder that the values he embodied continue through the next generation. We were honored to recognize all who have served our country and especially grateful to Augusto's family for sharing this heartfelt tribute with our community.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
522 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 378 0 R
/E (Thank you to everyone who participated, created a float, volunteered, and came out to cheer along the route. The incredible turnout made this a memorable celebration for our entire community)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
