/P 379 0 R
/E (We were honored to welcome Vineyard resident and Team USA Olympian Caleb Furnell as the first-ever Grand Marshal of the Vineyard Days Parade!)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
526 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 379 0 R
/E (Caleb represented the United States at the 2026 Winter Olympics as a member of the U.S. four-man bobsled team. Before competing on the world stage, he was a standout sprinter at Utah Valley University, earning All-WAC honors and helping lead a conference championship relay team. His journey from track athlete to Olympian happened in just over a year after attending a bobsled combine, a testament to his dedication and determination.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
527 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
